---
/** The gallery index's counts, computed from src/data/gallery.mjs at build time. */
import { census } from '../../data/gallery.mjs';

const c = census();
---

<p>
  MapLibre's gallery has {c.upstreamTotal} examples, and {c.upstreamWithPages} of them have a page
  here: {c.upstreamPagesYaml} in YAML alone and {c.upstreamPagesYamlJs} with some page JavaScript.
  The rest are listed, folded, under each group, with what you would write instead. The gallery
  also has {c.ownPages} pages of its own: files read straight from a web server, and two Mapzen
  classics.
</p>
